<title>FRANCE: Imetal nine month sales stagnate.</title>
<headline>Imetal nine month sales stagnate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 6,041    vs    5,908</p>
<p>    -- of which third quarter		  2,084    vs    1,843</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said in the BALO official bulletin that on a like-for-like basis sales would have been down 0.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
